---
import { portfolioData } from '../../data/portfolio';
import { renderExperience } from '../../lib/render';
const { experience } = portfolioData;
---

<section id="experience" class="scroll-mt-20 py-14 sm:py-20 border-t border-[var(--border)]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[76rem] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-[46rem]">
      <p class="reveal text-label text-[var(--signal)] mb-2">01 · Career Path</p>
      <h2 class="reveal-wipe text-h2 text-[var(--fg)]">
        Work Experience · <span class="text-[var(--signal)] font-mono">Professional Journey</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="reveal text-lead mt-3 text-[var(--muted-fg)]" style="--d: 0.08s">
        Từ quản trị hệ thống Linux nội bộ đến thiết kế và tự động hóa các cụm Kubernetes High-Availability quy mô lớn.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div id="journey-container" class="timeline-container mt-12 sm:mt-16">
      <div class="timeline-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div id="journey-progress-bar" class="timeline-progress" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div id="bind-experience" class="space-y-10" set:html={renderExperience(experience)}></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
